        "summary": "Congratulations Earthling! The Citizens of Planet Phrohmaj have invited you to join their Great Tile Flipping Festival, an honor of the highest sort. Tile flipping influences their customs, their eating habits, and even their vacations. Solve maddening puzzles while watching for the mishievous aliens who think confusing you is part of the fun. If they weren't so cute you'd wring their necks...if they had them.",
