        "name": "Protector: Special Edition",
        "summary": "Protector SE is an update of Songbird's earlier Protector, which shares many similarities to Defender. The Special Edition version includes many improvements over the original game, including new waves, new enemies, new landscapes, gameplay enhancements, and more. Please visit the Protector SE Page at Songbird Productions for more information.",
